OL,13,G     with Jane Goodall
OL,14,     FDr Rebeca Atencia sets out to
OL,15,     Frescue an illegally kept pet
OL,16,     Fmandrill, but encounters
OL,17,     Fresistance from angry villagers.
OL,18,G0440 Rescued Chimpanzees of the Congo
OL,19,G     with Jane Goodall
OL,20,     FEverybody is delighted when Wounda
OL,21,     Fthe chimp gives birth to a healthy
OL,22,     Fmale they name Hope.
